-- statement:
--   **The entry computes the register file.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6ILGenE`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.IL.genE_sp (s : IState HS) {m q W T e P L a b c M Bb : ℕ} (hM : zsz (M : ℤ) ≤ Bb)
--       (h : EntB m q W T e P L a b c M) :
--       Sp (genE m q W T) (encK s (fDesc e P L a b c))
--         (encK s (regState (fDesc e P L a b c) (vEnt m q W T e P L a b c) genD))
--         (cGenE m q W T e Bb)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round six, item language: the entry of the general procedure
--
--   The general procedure reads the descriptor `DescG` (`dT = e`, `dP, dL, dA, dB, dC`) and creates
--   a register file `genD` holding `f = e / m`, `r = e mod m`, `N = q ^ f`, `q ^ r`, `N ^ m`,
--   `L' = L / W`, `vol A`, and the level volumes `vol (P :: L' :: A)`, `q ^ r vol B`, `q ^ r vol Cs`,
--   `v = vol (P :: L' :: hdShape A B' C' m N)`, `(T + W) v`, `T v` (`genE_sp`).
--
--   * `desc_split`: a state with the descriptor is a managed state over the descriptor values;
--   * `vEnt`: the valuation after the entry, with its values (`vEnt_vals`) and bounds.
